repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "The six nested classes of Boolean functions discussed by Carlet and Thornburgh are all distinct from six variables onward, rather than five. The archive proves the exact threshold, witnesses, and specified small-dimensional extension classifications. It does not alter the source paper’s main theorem about all affine restrictions."
